{{!-- context: recipientName, platformName, packageName, orderId, rejectionNote, actionUrl --}}
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">Hi {{recipientName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#111827;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Your brief was declined</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  The creator has declined the brief for order <span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;">{{orderId}}</span> (<strong>"{{packageName}}"</strong>), so this order has been cancelled and won't proceed.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fafafa;border:2px solid #111827;border-radius:12px;">
  <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;">Reason from the creator</p>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151;">{{rejectionNote}}</p>
</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  Any amount paid will be refunded to your original payment method.
</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 24px;">
  {{> actionButton url=actionUrl label="View order →"}}
</div>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280;">— The {{platformName}} team</p>
